# The sandboxd image only needs its independent Python package.  Keep Web
# source, Agent workspaces, deployment state and credentials out of its build
# context even if the image is rebuilt manually from the repository root.
*
!sandboxer/
!sandboxer/pyproject.toml
!sandboxer/src/
!sandboxer/src/**

.deploy/
config/
workplace/
Skills/
logs/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*secret*
**/*secrets*
**/*token*
**/*key*
